── FACT BEYOND A `without` LIMIT ── E0204_fact_beyond_a_without_limit.lt:4:42  [E0204]

This index can panic, but the module's header says `without panic`:

  2 │ without panic
    │         ───── the limit
  3 │ 
  4 │ pub fn first(prices: List<i64>) -> i64 { prices[0] }
    │                                          ^^^^^^^^^

A guard needs a test that gives `0 < prices.len()`.

To fix it, use `get`, with `0` for an index out of range:

  4 │ pub fn first(prices: List<i64>) -> i64 { prices.get(0) else 0 }
    │                                                ~~~~~ ~~~~~~~~
